Package: genoCompaR
Title: Utilities for Comparing Chinook Salmon Genotype/Haplotype Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bryan", "Nguyen", email = "Bryan.Nguyen@water.ca.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reading, comparison, and quality-control utilities for wide-format
    genotype/haplotype call sheets such as those produced by GT-seq panels.
    Provides pairwise and trio Mendelian compatibility checks for parentage
    screening, duplicate-sample detection, missingness summaries,
    heterozygote-excess screening for collapsed paralogous loci, and
    conversion between laboratory column layouts with VCF-validated alleles.
